@startuml mo_house_pdf
title mo_house_pdf: House bill document PDFs + text
start
:read the mo_house link tables (texts, summaries, fiscal notes,
amendments; bills and Senate acts), keep the kinds selected by
MOGOV_HOUSE_PDF_KINDS and the sessions in MOGOV_HOUSE_PDF_SESSIONS;
note right
  Witness forms and change maps are never linked here.
end note
:one unit per distinct URL, owned by hash(URL) % --shards;
repeat
  if (file already under RAW_DIR/mo_house_pdf/SESSION/KIND/
and (closed session or younger than 7 days)?) then (yes)
    if (size and mtime match the previous
mo_house_pdf_files row?) then (yes)
      :keep the row (hash known): file not read,
      text from the pdftext cache by that hash;
    else (no)
      :read it from disk, hash it;
    endif
    :no request;
  elseif (no file, and the previous row is a permanent failure
(HTTP 4xx or HTML page) of a closed session
checked < 30 days ago?) then (yes)
    :keep the previous error row: no request;
  elseif (run limited by KINDS / SESSIONS and outside them?) then (yes)
    :carry the previous row over (error history kept);
  else (no)
    :GET at the host-wide throttle (1 request/s,
    shared with mo_house and every shard);
    note right
      A stale open-session file is re-checked with
      If-None-Match / If-Modified-Since from the previous row.
    end note
    if (304 Not Modified?) then (yes)
      :touch the file, keep its row and hash;
    elseif (PDF bytes (%PDF-)?) then (yes)
      if (bytes differ from the file on disk?) then (yes)
        :write the PDF unchanged;
      else (no)
        :touch the file only;
      endif
    elseif (file already on disk?) then (yes)
      :keep that file, row and text;
      :log mo_house_pdf.recheck_failed, retry next run;
    else (HTTP error, timeout, HTML page)
      :error row, no file (4xx / HTML: not asked again for 30 days);
    endif
  endif
  :pdfplumber text per page (mogov.pdftext, stored as-is,
  time budget per document);
  if (bill text version with text?) then (yes)
    :read the enacting title and Section A for the RSMo sections
    repealed, amended and enacted (mogov.parsers.mo_house_statute_refs);
    :rows in mo_house_pdf_statute_refs (ranges kept as written);
  endif
  :row in mo_house_pdf_files (path, size, sha256, status, error,
  checked_at, etag, last_modified)
  and row in mo_house_pdf_texts (page_count, text, pages_json, error);
repeat while (more URLs?) is (yes)
->no;
stop
@enduml
